<title>SRI LANKA: Cricket-Zimbabwe 20-0 in 2nd innings v Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Zimbabwe 20-0 in 2nd innings v Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe, following on 204 runs behind Sri Lanka on first innings, were 20 without loss in their second innings when rain halted play on the third day of the first test on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 349, Zimbabwe 145 and 20-0.</p>
